{"availability":"available","full":"a8cteam51/internet-archive-wayback-machine-link-fixer","name":"internet-archive-wayback-machine-link-fixer","description":"WordPress plugin that scans content for broken links and replaces them with archived Wayback Machine versions. Also auto-archives your own pages and unarchived site links for long-term accessibility. Uses Action Scheduler for background processing.","category":"Other","language":"PHP","stars":145,"forks":9,"created":"2023-10-18T21:33:08Z","updated":"2026-10-02T15:28:30Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"trunk","homepage":"https://wordpress.org/plugins/internet-archive-wayback-machine-link-fixer/","topics":["team51-plugin"],"demo":"https://www.loom.com/share/7551a8aa791849fc81c9aa21ada268f1?sid=510daff9-40db-4986-8137-56471a3c8149","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:32.625Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:32.625Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:32.625Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:32.625Z","stars":145,"forks":9}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Contributors: wpcomspecialprojects Tags: wayback machine, internet archive, broken links, archive links Requires at least: 6.4 Tested up to: 7.1 Requires PHP: 7.4 Stable tag: 1.5.0 License: GPL-3.0-or-later License URI:","Internet Archive Wayback Machine Link Fixer is a WordPress plugin designed to combat link rot—the gradual decay of web links as pages are moved, changed, or taken down. It automatically scans your post content—on save and across existing posts—to detect outbound links. For each one, it checks the Internet Archive’s Wayback Machine for an archived version and creates a snapshot if one isn’t available.","When a linked page disappears, the plugin helps preserve your user experience by redirecting visitors to a reliable archived version. It also works proactively by archiving your own posts every time they’re updated, creating a consistent backup of your content’s history.